WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.974
The Antarctic Ice Sheet is the largest desert on Earth.
南极冰盖是地球上最大的沙漠。

2
00:00:05.974 --> 00:00:10.628
The Arctic is the second largest desert.
北极是第二大沙漠。

3
00:00:10.628 --> 00:00:15.522
The Sahara is the largest hot desert.
撒哈拉是最大的热沙漠。

4
00:00:15.522 --> 00:00:20.536
It covers a vast part of northern Africa.
它覆盖非洲北部的广阔地区。

5
00:00:20.536 --> 00:00:25.670
The Arabian Desert is in southwestern Asia.
阿拉伯沙漠在亚洲西南部。

6
00:00:25.670 --> 00:00:30.804
The Gobi Desert is in Mongolia and China.
戈壁沙漠在蒙古和中国。

7
00:00:30.804 --> 00:00:36.634
Tall mountains can block rain and make a rain shadow.
高山会挡住雨水，形成雨影。

8
00:00:36.634 --> 00:00:41.672
More huge deserts wait around the world.
世界各地还有更多大沙漠。

9
00:00:41.672 --> 00:00:47.574
Deserts are vast, dry, and often harsh.
沙漠广阔、干燥，常常严酷。

10
00:00:47.574 --> 00:00:54.748
Next time you hear desert, think hot sand—and cold ice too!
下次听到沙漠，想想热沙子——还有冷冰！
